// Each original-format consumer receives valid sixteen-route records, with
// reversed full-record route order and one-route tails. The producer's separate
// ownership test checks its publication contract. Here, independent F64
// arithmetic ignores record order and checks every output, inactive output
// sentinels, and immutable task/weight storage. The GPU traverses every K block.
